# Execution environment

- Windows x64; use PowerShell 7 (`pwsh`), native cmdlets and Windows-compatible paths. No Bash, WSL, POSIX utilities or `cmd.exe`.
- Use `rg` / `rg --files` for text and file searches. Semantic C# navigation has its own [rule](csharp-navigation.mdc).
- Run Git with `--no-pager`; avoid interactive pagers.
- Toolchain: .NET 10 / C# 14. Run from the repository root:

```powershell
dotnet build SqlToAi.slnx
dotnet test SqlToAi.slnx
```

See [development documentation](../../docs/development.md) for CLI, publishing and release procedures.
